abstract: >-
  Machine-checked formal companion for Verification Asymmetry under AI
  Substitution. The current-paper theorem map covers the numbered mathematical
  objects and displayed derivations of the EINT manuscript, with one typed
  declaration per formal claim, exact per-claim axiom boundaries, explicit
  scope-only prose, and exact-object consumption bridges.
